@startuml "Sauvegarde et maintenance"

title Sauvegarde et maintenance

participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "File Storage\n(AWS S3)" as Storage
participant "Cache Layer\n(Redis)" as Cache
participant "Message Queue\n(Bull/Redis)" as Queue
participant "Monitoring\n(Prometheus)" as Monitoring

note over DB: Daily backup
DB -> Storage: Export database dump
Storage --> DB: Backup stored

note over Cache: Memory optimization
Cache -> Cache: FLUSHDB expired keys
Cache -> Cache: Optimize memory usage

note over Queue: Queue maintenance
Queue -> Queue: Clean completed jobs
Queue -> Queue: Retry failed jobs
Queue -> Monitoring: Report queue metrics

@enduml